  "narrative": [
    {
      "text": "A forest plot of percentage agreement between TBST and QFT in BCG-vaccinated children with active TB: DST 5mm vs QFT 97.01% (Starshinova 2018) and DST AI vs QFT 100.00% (Nakonechnaya 2020). The overall random-effects pooled agreement is 97.65% (93.90–99.11) across 170 participants.",
      "lang": "en",
      "state": "draft",
      "drafted_by": {
        "kind": "agent",
        "id": "claude-code",
        "model": "not-disclosed",
        "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt7LJVddPRBy6F6BnEb"
      },
      "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
    },
    {
      "text": "مخطط شجري لنسبة التوافق بين اختبارات TBST وQFT لدى الأطفال الملقَّحين بلقاح BCG والمصابين بالسل النشط: DST 5 مم مقابل QFT 97.01% (Starshinova 2018)، وDST AI مقابل QFT 100.00% (Nakonechnaya 2020). ويبلغ التوافق المجمّع الإجمالي 97.65% (93.90–99.11) لدى 170 مشاركاً.",
